🇺🇸🇷🇺🇮🇷NEW VIDEO: US-Directed Strikes on Russian AI & Energy Centers As False US Diplomacy Floated

On YouTube: https://youtu.be/nTj4R1KYX7Y?si=2afUYstJ9vF5ASge

▪️The US is degrading critical Russian capabilities both in terms of AI development and energy production/exports while suffering no losses to its own capabilities at home; 

▪️False diplomacy has allowed the US to buy time and space for future pressure and hostilities against not only Russia, but also Iran and China; 

▪️The only reason Russia, Iran, and China likely tolerate these brief pauses in hostility is because it affords them additional time as well to reorganize, rearm, and prepare for further tension; 

▪️The future will be decided based on who is using this time better;
